@startuml SE_22_JoinQueue
title Sequence Diagram: SE_22 Quét mã QR - Tham gia hàng đợi (Join Queue)

actor "Bệnh nhân" as Patient
participant "Mobile App / Kiosk" as View
participant "CheckInController" as Controller
participant "CheckInQueueService" as Service
participant "AppointmentRepository" as ApptRepo
participant "CheckInQueueRepository" as QueueRepo
participant "NotificationService" as NotifService
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Patient -> View: Quét mã QR tại quầy
activate View

View -> Controller: scan(qrData)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: processScan(qrData)
activate Service

Service -> Service: resolvePatientId(qrData)
note right: Giải mã JWT hoặc parse CHECKIN:id

Service -> QueueRepo: findTodayForPatient(patientId)
activate QueueRepo
QueueRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM check_in_queue WHERE ...
activate DB
DB --> QueueRepo: list
deactivate DB
QueueRepo --> Service: existingQueues
deactivate QueueRepo

alt Đã có trong hàng đợi (Already checked-in)
    Service -> Service: calculateEstimatedWaitTime(activeQueue)
    Service --> Controller: CheckInResult.alreadyCheckedIn(...)
else Chưa có trong hàng đợi
    Service -> ApptRepo: findTodayByPatientId(patientId)
    activate ApptRepo
    ApptRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM appointments WHERE ...
    activate DB
    DB --> ApptRepo: appointments
    deactivate DB
    ApptRepo --> Service: todayAppointments
    deactivate ApptRepo

    alt Không có lịch hẹn
        Service -> Service: createWalkInAppointment(patient)
        Service -> ApptRepo: save(walkInAppt)
    end

    Service -> Service: Xác định phòng khám (ClinicRoom)
    note right: Lấy từ Doctor của Appointment hoặc mặc định

    Service -> QueueRepo: findMaxQueueNumber(roomId)
    activate QueueRepo
    QueueRepo -> DB: SELECT MAX(queue_number) ...
    activate DB
    DB --> QueueRepo: currentMax
    deactivate DB
    QueueRepo --> Service: currentMax
    deactivate QueueRepo

    Service -> Service: create CheckInQueue (priorityLevel = 0, status = WAITING)
    
    Service -> QueueRepo: save(queueEntry)
    activate QueueRepo
    QueueRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO check_in_queue ...
    activate DB
    DB --> QueueRepo: success
    deactivate DB
    QueueRepo --> Service: savedQueueEntry
    deactivate QueueRepo

    Service -> NotifService: gửi thông báo (FCM)
    Service -> Service: broadcastQueueUpdated(roomId) <<WebSocket>>
    
    Service -> Service: calculateEstimatedWaitTime(queue)
    Service -> Service: calculateQueuePosition(queue)
    
    Service --> Controller: CheckInResult.success(...)
end

deactivate Service

Controller --> View: 200 OK (CheckInResult)
deactivate Controller

View --> Patient: Hiển thị STT, số người phía trước & thời gian chờ
deactivate View

@enduml
